#. 6.0->settings-schema.json->windows-opaque-maximized->description
msgid "Make windows opaque when maximized or full-screen"
msgstr ""

#. 6.0->settings-schema.json->windows-opaque-maximized->tooltip
msgid ""
"When enabled, windows with Blur Cinnamon effects will be made fully opaque "
"while they are maximized or full-screen, ignoring the \"Opacity\" setting in "
"the table above. The configured opacity is restored once the window is no "
"longer maximized or full-screen."
